\label{ass:D'neq0}
     For any sample size $n$, the gradient of divergence function $D$ satisfies $\mathbb{E}_n[{\nabla_1 D }(\Sigma_0, \widehat\Sigma_n)]\neq 0$ and there exists strictly positive constants $C_1$ and $C_2$ such that 
