    \begin{equation}
        \lim_{n\to\infty} n^2  \rho_n^\star =  \rho^\star,   
    \end{equation}
    where the limit $ \rho^\star$ depends on the choice of divergence function $D$ and the constants $C_1$ and $C_2$.

